---
/** FeatureCards — Figma node 8:333 */
---

<section class="bg-light-gray pt-28 pb-12 sm:pt-32 sm:pb-20 lg:pt-32 lg:pb-28">
  <div class="max-w-[1232px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Section label + divider -->
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-dark mb-4">More than a till</p>
    <div class="w-12 h-0.5 bg-accent mb-12 sm:mb-16"></div>

    <!-- Heading -->
    <h2 data-reveal class="font-heading font-medium text-dark leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-8 max-w-3xl" style="font-size: clamp(1.875rem, 4.5vw, 3.75rem);">
      More than a till
    </h2>
    <p data-reveal="fade" style="--reveal-delay: 200ms;" class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-text mb-16 sm:mb-20 max-w-3xl">
      A properly set up pub system should do far more than take payments. The right EPOS platform connects every part of your business:
    </p>

    <!-- Feature cards grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 sm:gap-x-12 sm:gap-y-16" data-reveal-group="cards">
      <!-- Card 1: Loyalty -->
      <div data-reveal>
        <div class="mb-4">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-dark" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 8.25c0-2.485-2.099-4.5-4.688-4.5-1.935 0-3.597 1.126-4.312 2.733-.715-1.607-2.377-2.733-4.313-2.733C5.1 3.75 3 5.765 3 8.25c0 7.22 9 12 9 12s9-4.78 9-12z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full h-0.5 bg-accent mb-6"></div>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-medium text-dark text-xl sm:text-2xl mb-3">Customer loyalty programmes</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-text leading-relaxed">Reward your regulars and bring them back.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Marketing -->
      <div data-reveal>
        <div class="mb-4">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-dark" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.34 15.84c-.688-.06-1.386-.09-2.09-.09H7.5a4.5 4.5 0 110-9h.75c.704 0 1.402-.03 2.09-.09m0 9.18c.253.962.584 1.892.985 2.783.247.55.06 1.21-.463 1.511l-.657.38c-.551.318-1.26.117-1.527-.461a20.845 20.845 0 01-1.44-4.282m3.102.069a18.03 18.03 0 01-.59-4.59c0-1.586.205-3.124.59-4.59m0 9.18a23.848 23.848 0 018.835 2.535M10.34 6.66a23.847 23.847 0 008.835-2.535m0 0A23.74 23.74 0 0018.795 3m.38 1.125a23.91 23.91 0 011.014 5.395m-1.014 8.855c-.118.38-.245.754-.38 1.125m.38-1.125a23.91 23.91 0 001.014-5.395m0-3.46c.495.413.811 1.035.811 1.73 0 .695-.316 1.317-.811 1.73m0-3.46a24.347 24.347 0 010 3.46" /></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full h-0.5 bg-accent mb-6"></div>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-medium text-dark text-xl sm:text-2xl mb-3">Marketing tools</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-text leading-relaxed">Communicate with your customers directly.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Bookings -->
      <div data-reveal>
        <div class="mb-4">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-dark" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full h-0.5 bg-accent mb-6"></div>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-medium text-dark text-xl sm:text-2xl mb-3">Bookings and reservations</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-text leading-relaxed">Manage tables and appointments in one place.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Online ordering -->
      <div data-reveal>
        <div class="mb-4">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-dark" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 3h1.386c.51 0 .955.343 1.087.835l.383 1.437M7.5 14.25a3 3 0 00-3 3h15.75m-12.75-3h11.218c1.121-2.3 2.1-4.684 2.924-7.138a60.114 60.114 0 00-16.536-1.84M7.5 14.25L5.106 5.272M6 20.25a.75.75 0 11-1.5 0 .75.75 0 011.5 0zm12.75 0a.75.75 0 11-1.5 0 .75.75 0 011.5 0z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full h-0.5 bg-accent mb-6"></div>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-medium text-dark text-xl sm:text-2xl mb-3">Online ordering</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-text leading-relaxed">Fully integrated with your in-venue EPOS, no duplication.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5: Invoicing -->
      <div data-reveal>
        <div class="mb-4">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-dark" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h3.75M9 15h3.75M9 18h3.75m3 .75H18a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25V6.108c0-1.135-.845-2.098-1.976-2.192a48.424 48.424 0 00-1.123-.08m-5.801 0c-.065.21-.1.433-.1.664 0 .414.336.75.75.75h4.5a.75.75 0 00.75-.75 2.25 2.25 0 00-.1-.664m-5.8 0A2.251 2.251 0 0113.5 2.25H15c1.012 0 1.867.668 2.15 1.586m-5.8 0c-.376.023-.75.05-1.124.08C9.095 4.01 8.25 4.973 8.25 6.108V8.25m0 0H4.875c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v11.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h9.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V9.375c0-.621-.504-1.125-1.125-1.125H8.25z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full h-0.5 bg-accent mb-6"></div>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-medium text-dark text-xl sm:text-2xl mb-3">Invoicing</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-text leading-relaxed">Supplier management built into your system.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 6: Funding -->
      <div data-reveal>
        <div class="mb-4">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-dark" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18.75a60.07 60.07 0 0115.797 2.101c.727.198 1.453-.342 1.453-1.096V18.75M3.75 4.5v.75A.75.75 0 013 6h-.75m0 0v-.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125H20.25M2.25 6v9m18-10.5v.75c0 .414.336.75.75.75h.75m-1.5-1.5h.375c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v9.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-.375m1.5-1.5H21a.75.75 0 00-.75.75v.75m0 0H3.75m0 0h-.375a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V15m1.5 1.5v-.75A.75.75 0 003 15h-.75M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm3 0h.008v.008H18V10.5zm-12 0h.008v.008H6V10.5z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full h-0.5 bg-accent mb-6"></div>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-medium text-dark text-xl sm:text-2xl mb-3">Gift cards</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-text leading-relaxed">Another revenue stream, set up properly from day one.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Closing copy + funding bullets -->
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-text mt-16 max-w-3xl">
      And where it helps, I can also connect you with:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg text-gray-text mt-4 space-y-2 max-w-3xl">
      <li><strong class="text-dark">Free business bank accounts</strong></li>
      <li><strong class="text-dark">Merchant cash advance</strong></li>
      <li><strong class="text-dark">Flexi-loans</strong></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-text mt-6 max-w-3xl">
      Everything through one conversation. Everything with someone who understands hospitality.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
